! HF def2-QZVPP TightSCF KeepDens NoUseSym
# def2-QZVPP puts a g shell on O (7s4p3d2f1g) and an f shell on H, so this is the exact upper
# edge of what the ESP pair table supports. Small enough to run on a laptop core in seconds.
%pal nprocs 1 end
%maxcore 2000
* xyz 0 1
O   0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.000000   0.757000   0.587000
H   0.000000  -0.757000   0.587000
*
